        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "cw02s",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Meanwhile, clients in 2026 choose contractors like this: they google, open 3–5 websites, compare portfolios and prices, and send 1–2 enquiries. No website — you're not in that comparison. Instagram doesn't save you: it doesn't rank in Google, and a profile without a site reads as \"small crew\"."
