              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "2. A page per service. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "cw02z",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "\"Home renovation\", \"commercial fit-out\", \"extensions\" — each is searched separately. A single \"our services\" list page ranks for none of them."
